{"id":"steam-1358660","steam":1358660,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Re:Awaken","summary":"Purify negativity from the afterlife and bring together the children of fate! Swear oaths to divine beasts and wield powerful twilight abilities in this anime inspired roguelite adventure.","about":"Purify negativity from the afterlife and bring together the children of fate! Swear oaths with divine animals and wield powerful twilight abilities in this anime inspired roguelite adventure. \r\n\r\n\nBattle through the afterlife\n \r\nTake down enemies while balancing the powers of blessings and curses. The more foes you defeat, the more chances you get to sync your soul with remnants of the fallen. \r\n\r\n\r\n\nRepair broken relationships \n\r\nExperience an Isekai story like never before! A dispute across the ages has finally reached a tipping point and it's up to you to rekindle the relationship of children with over a million years worth of issues. \r\n\r\n\nBefriend Divine Beasts\n\r\nEvery new choice offers a chance to receive new abilities to improve every run! Earn permanent upgrades to equip at the start of each run, but only after swearing your loyalty to a divine beast.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/library_600x900.jpg?t=1741892665","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/header.jpg?t=1741892665","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/library_hero.jpg?t=1741892665","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/header.jpg?t=1741892665","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1741892665","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358660/ss_c09fc028c48250a616ba3591646460147d8498e8.600x338.jpg?t=1741892665","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st